  "APIProfile":       "Basic",
  "Description":      "Audio Scene Editing: composes AudioObjects into an AudioScene, places them, and sets the listener's Point of View. One scene is open at a time. OPENING IS DONE BY PORT: an existing scene arrives on AudioSceneDescriptors, by identifier or in full; creation opens implicitly. ACTING IS DONE BY COMMAND on the UserCommand Port, against the open scene, which is why no Command needs to name it. Receives AudioObjects from CAE-AOE across the Topology; it does not call that AIM.",

